    "Everything here is free, forever. If you'd like to help fund development, this is a purely optional, one-time contribution — it doesn't unlock anything, it just marks your account as a supporter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Hier ist alles kostenlos, für immer. Wenn du die Entwicklung unterstützen möchtest, ist dies ein rein freiwilliger, einmaliger Beitrag – er schaltet nichts frei, er kennzeichnet dich nur als Unterstützer:in."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Aquí todo es gratis, para siempre. Si quieres ayudar a financiar el desarrollo, esta es una contribución única y totalmente opcional: no desbloquea nada, solo te marca como colaborador."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tout est gratuit ici, pour toujours. Si vous souhaitez financer le développement, voici une contribution ponctuelle et entièrement facultative – elle ne débloque rien, elle vous identifie simplement comme soutien."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ここではすべてずっと無料です。開発を支援したい場合は、完全に任意の1回限りの支援ができます。何もロック解除されず、サポーターであることが表示されるだけです。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tudo aqui é gratuito, para sempre. Se quiser ajudar a financiar o desenvolvimento, esta é uma contribuição única e totalmente opcional — ela não desbloqueia nada, apenas marca você como apoiador."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "这里的一切永久免费。如果你愿意资助开发，这是一次完全自愿的一次性支持——它不会解锁任何内容，只会将你标记为支持者。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything here is free, forever. If you'd like to help fund development, this is a purely optional, one-time contribution — it doesn't unlock anything, it just marks your account as a supporter."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Support Development Card (Sources/Features/Settings/SupportDevelopmentCard.swift)"
