    "Platterhead is free software: the complete source code is public at github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm, under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. Because the GPL's own terms conflict with the App Store's distribution terms, an additional permission under GPLv3 §7 specifically allows distributing Platterhead through the App Store, provided the source of the exact version distributed stays publicly available under this License — which it does, at the address above. Full text, including that permission: the LICENSE file in the repository." : {
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Settings (Sources/Features/Settings/SettingsView.swift)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead ist freie Software: Der vollständige Quellcode ist unter github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm öffentlich verfügbar, unter der GNU General Public License v3.0 oder neuer. Da die Bedingungen der GPL mit den Vertriebsbedingungen des App Store kollidieren, erlaubt eine zusätzliche Genehmigung nach GPLv3 §7 ausdrücklich den Vertrieb von Platterhead über den App Store, sofern der Quellcode genau der vertriebenen Version unter dieser Lizenz öffentlich verfügbar bleibt – was unter der obigen Adresse der Fall ist. Volltext einschließlich dieser Genehmigung: die Datei LICENSE im Repository."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Platterhead is free software: the complete source code is public at github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm, under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. Because the GPL's own terms conflict with the App Store's distribution terms, an additional permission under GPLv3 §7 specifically allows distributing Platterhead through the App Store, provided the source of the exact version distributed stays publicly available under this License — which it does, at the address above. Full text, including that permission: the LICENSE file in the repository."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead es software libre: el código fuente completo es público en github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm, bajo la Licencia Pública General de GNU v3.0 o posterior. Como los términos de la GPL entran en conflicto con las condiciones de distribución del App Store, un permiso adicional según la sección 7 de la GPLv3 autoriza expresamente a distribuir Platterhead a través del App Store, siempre que el código fuente de la versión exacta distribuida siga disponible públicamente bajo esta licencia, como ocurre en la dirección indicada. Texto completo, incluido ese permiso: el archivo LICENSE del repositorio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead est un logiciel libre : son code source complet est public sur github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm, sous licence publique générale GNU v3.0 ou ultérieure. Les termes de la GPL étant incompatibles avec les conditions de distribution de l’App Store, une autorisation supplémentaire au titre de l’article 7 de la GPLv3 permet expressément de distribuer Platterhead via l’App Store, à condition que le code source de la version exacte distribuée reste publiquement disponible sous cette licence – ce qui est le cas à l’adresse ci-dessus. Texte intégral, y compris cette autorisation : le fichier LICENSE du dépôt."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterheadはフリーソフトウェアです。完全なソースコードはGNU一般公衆利用許諾書バージョン3.0以降のもと、github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearmで公開されています。GPLの条項はApp Storeの配布条件と矛盾するため、GPLv3第7条に基づく追加許可により、配布した版と同一のソースコードが本ライセンスのもとで公開され続けることを条件に、App StoreでのPlatterheadの配布が明示的に認められています。ソースコードは上記のアドレスで公開されています。この許可を含む全文は、リポジトリのLICENSEファイルをご覧ください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O Platterhead é software livre: o código-fonte completo é público em github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm, sob a Licença Pública Geral GNU v3.0 ou posterior. Como os termos da GPL conflitam com as condições de distribuição da App Store, uma permissão adicional nos termos da seção 7 da GPLv3 autoriza especificamente a distribuição do Platterhead pela App Store, desde que o código-fonte da versão exata distribuída continue disponível publicamente sob esta Licença — o que acontece, no endereço acima. Texto completo, incluindo essa permissão: o arquivo LICENSE no repositório."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead 是自由软件：完整源代码依据 GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0 或更高版本公开于 github.com/johnarleyburns/parso-tonearm。由于 GPL 自身的条款与 App Store 的分发条款相冲突，依据 GPLv3 第 7 条的附加许可明确允许通过 App Store 分发 Platterhead，前提是所分发确切版本的源代码依本许可证保持公开——上述地址即可获取。包含该许可的全文：见代码库中的 LICENSE 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Platterhead picks one genre at random — or a playlist you haven't mixed lately — and chains tracks that each stay within 8% of the last one's tempo, in a matching key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead wählt zufällig ein Genre – oder eine Playlist, die du länger nicht gemixt hast – und reiht Titel aneinander, die jeweils innerhalb von 8 % des vorherigen Tempos und in einer passenden Tonart bleiben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Platterhead picks one genre at random — or a playlist you haven't mixed lately — and chains tracks that each stay within 8% of the last one's tempo, in a matching key."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead elige un género al azar —o una lista que no hayas mezclado últimamente— y encadena pistas que se mantienen a menos del 8 % del tempo de la anterior, en una tonalidad compatible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead choisit un genre au hasard — ou une playlist que tu n’as pas mixée récemment — et enchaîne des morceaux qui restent chacun à moins de 8 % du tempo du précédent, dans une tonalité compatible."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterheadがジャンルを1つランダムに選び(または最近ミックスしていないプレイリストを選び)、前の曲のテンポから8%以内で相性の良いキーの曲をつなげます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O Platterhead escolhe um gênero ao acaso — ou uma playlist que você não mixou recentemente — e encadeia faixas que ficam a até 8% do andamento da anterior, em um tom compatível."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead 会随机选择一种风格（或你最近没有混音过的播放列表），串联速度与上一首相差不超过 8% 且调性匹配的曲目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
