    "Platterhead's audio engine vendors permissively-licensed open-source libraries for decode/encode and DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus, and others) — BSD, MIT, and public-domain terms. See parso-audio-engine's ATTRIBUTION.md for the complete per-file list." : {
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Settings (Sources/Features/Settings/SettingsView.swift)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Audio-Engine von Platterhead enthält freizügig lizenzierte Open-Source-Bibliotheken für Dekodierung/Kodierung und DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus und weitere) – unter BSD-, MIT- und Public-Domain-Bedingungen. Die vollständige Liste pro Datei steht in ATTRIBUTION.md von parso-audio-engine."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Platterhead's audio engine vendors permissively-licensed open-source libraries for decode/encode and DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus, and others) — BSD, MIT, and public-domain terms. See parso-audio-engine's ATTRIBUTION.md for the complete per-file list."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El motor de audio de Platterhead incluye bibliotecas de código abierto con licencias permisivas para decodificación/codificación y DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus y otras), bajo términos BSD, MIT y de dominio público. Consulta ATTRIBUTION.md de parso-audio-engine para ver la lista completa por archivo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le moteur audio de Platterhead intègre des bibliothèques open source sous licence permissive pour le décodage/encodage et le DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus, entre autres) – sous licences BSD, MIT et domaine public. Consultez ATTRIBUTION.md de parso-audio-engine pour la liste complète, fichier par fichier."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterheadのオーディオエンジンには、デコード／エンコードやDSPのための寛容なライセンスのオープンソースライブラリ（libFLAC、libebur128、libsamplerate、libogg/libopusなど）が含まれています。ライセンスはBSD、MIT、パブリックドメインです。ファイルごとの完全な一覧はparso-audio-engineのATTRIBUTION.mdをご覧ください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O mecanismo de áudio do Platterhead inclui bibliotecas de código aberto com licenças permissivas para decodificação/codificação e DSP (libFLAC, libebur128, libsamplerate, libogg/libopus e outras) — sob os termos BSD, MIT e de domínio público. Veja o ATTRIBUTION.md do parso-audio-engine para a lista completa por arquivo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Platterhead 的音频引擎内含采用宽松许可的开源库，用于解码/编码和 DSP（libFLAC、libebur128、libsamplerate、libogg/libopus 等），适用 BSD、MIT 及公有领域条款。完整的逐文件列表请参阅 parso-audio-engine 的 ATTRIBUTION.md。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
