    "The optional \"Also export MP3\" option on a finished recording uses LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later. LAME's source is vendored in this app's own source tree (Sources/CLAMEBridge) — parso-audio-engine itself never links or depends on LAME; it only declares the protocol this app's LAME wrapper implements. Recordings themselves are always saved as M4A/AAC; MP3 is produced only as an additional copy at export time. See docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md and docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine) for how this works." : {
      "comment" : "UI text shown in: Settings (Sources/Features/Settings/SettingsView.swift)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die optionale Option „Auch als MP3 exportieren“ bei einer fertigen Aufnahme verwendet LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), lizenziert unter LGPL-2.1 oder neuer. Der LAME-Quellcode ist im eigenen Quellbaum dieser App enthalten (Sources/CLAMEBridge) – parso-audio-engine selbst bindet LAME nie ein und hängt nicht davon ab; die Engine deklariert nur das Protokoll, das der LAME-Wrapper dieser App implementiert. Aufnahmen selbst werden immer als M4A/AAC gesichert; MP3 entsteht nur als zusätzliche Kopie beim Export. Wie das funktioniert, steht in docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md und docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The optional \"Also export MP3\" option on a finished recording uses LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later. LAME's source is vendored in this app's own source tree (Sources/CLAMEBridge) — parso-audio-engine itself never links or depends on LAME; it only declares the protocol this app's LAME wrapper implements. Recordings themselves are always saved as M4A/AAC; MP3 is produced only as an additional copy at export time. See docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md and docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine) for how this works."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La opción «Exportar también en MP3» de una grabación terminada usa LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), con licencia LGPL-2.1 o posterior. El código de LAME está incluido en el árbol de código propio de esta app (Sources/CLAMEBridge); parso-audio-engine nunca enlaza ni depende de LAME: solo declara el protocolo que implementa el envoltorio de LAME de esta app. Las grabaciones se guardan siempre en M4A/AAC; el MP3 solo se genera como copia adicional al exportar. Consulta docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md y docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine) para saber cómo funciona."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "L’option facultative « Exporter aussi en MP3 » d’un enregistrement terminé utilise LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), sous licence LGPL-2.1 ou ultérieure. Le code source de LAME est intégré à l’arborescence propre de cette app (Sources/CLAMEBridge) – parso-audio-engine ne lie jamais LAME et n’en dépend pas ; il déclare seulement le protocole qu’implémente l’adaptateur LAME de cette app. Les enregistrements sont toujours sauvegardés en M4A/AAC ; le MP3 n’est produit qu’en copie supplémentaire à l’export. Consultez docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md et docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine) pour le fonctionnement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "完成した録音の「MP3でも書き出す」オプションは、LGPL-2.1以降でライセンスされたLAME 3.100（libmp3lame）を使用します。LAMEのソースはこのアプリ自身のソースツリー（Sources/CLAMEBridge）に含まれており、parso-audio-engine自体はLAMEをリンクしたり依存したりすることはありません。エンジンが宣言するのは、このアプリのLAMEラッパーが実装するプロトコルだけです。録音自体は常にM4A/AACで保存され、MP3は書き出し時に追加のコピーとしてのみ作成されます。仕組みについてはdocs/GPL-BACKENDS.mdとdocs/BYO-CODEC.md（parso-audio-engine）をご覧ください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "A opção “Exportar também em MP3” de uma gravação concluída usa o LAME 3.100 (libmp3lame), licenciado sob LGPL-2.1 ou posterior. O código do LAME está incluído na árvore de código-fonte deste app (Sources/CLAMEBridge) — o parso-audio-engine nunca vincula nem depende do LAME; ele apenas declara o protocolo que o wrapper LAME deste app implementa. As gravações são sempre salvas em M4A/AAC; o MP3 só é gerado como cópia adicional na exportação. Veja docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md e docs/BYO-CODEC.md (parso-audio-engine) para entender como funciona."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "完成录音后的可选“同时导出 MP3”功能使用 LAME 3.100（libmp3lame），采用 LGPL-2.1 或更高版本许可。LAME 源代码包含在本 App 自己的源代码树中（Sources/CLAMEBridge）——parso-audio-engine 本身从不链接或依赖 LAME，只声明本 App 的 LAME 封装所实现的协议。录音本身始终以 M4A/AAC 保存；MP3 仅在导出时作为额外副本生成。工作原理请参阅 docs/GPL-BACKENDS.md 和 docs/BYO-CODEC.md（parso-audio-engine）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
